# Keep this repository portable: track only the skill itself and reusable
# scaffolds. Local training material, third-party checkouts, live-device
# evidence, generated targets, and campaign outputs stay out of git.

# Ignore everything by default.
*

# Repository metadata files.
!.gitignore
!SKILL.md
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Skill references.
!references/
!references/**

# Runtime primitives.
!scripts/
!scripts/*.py

# Reusable assets and LibAFL scaffolds.
!assets/
!assets/README.md
!assets/campaign_manifest.template.md

!assets/rust_libafl_cli_command_fuzzer/
!assets/rust_libafl_cli_command_fuzzer/Cargo.toml
!assets/rust_libafl_cli_command_fuzzer/Cargo.lock
!assets/rust_libafl_cli_command_fuzzer/src/
!assets/rust_libafl_cli_command_fuzzer/src/**

!assets/rust_libafl_afl_forkserver_fuzzer/
!assets/rust_libafl_afl_forkserver_fuzzer/Cargo.toml
!assets/rust_libafl_afl_forkserver_fuzzer/Cargo.lock
!assets/rust_libafl_afl_forkserver_fuzzer/src/
!assets/rust_libafl_afl_forkserver_fuzzer/src/**

# Re-ignore generated caches/build outputs even inside allowed directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/target/
**/debug/
**/release/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Explicitly ignored non-portable work areas.
Fuzzing101/
LibAFL/
fuzzingbook-notebooks/
validation/
targets/
agents/
